# ===============================
# Generated binaries / large data
# Raw data and heavy generated artifacts do not belong in this repo;
# analysis code and small, reviewable result summaries do.
#
# The underlying PAC/pedigree/phenotype data is commercially sensitive
# (per the submitted manuscript's own Data Availability statement) and
# must never be committed, regardless of where it lands in the tree --
# blanket-ignore any "data/" directory anywhere, not just at the repo
# root, plus the raw file types themselves as defense-in-depth.
# ===============================
*.zip
*.tar.gz
*.tar.zst
data/
**/data/
*.rds.bak
*.csv
*.xlsx
*.xls
*.rds
*.parquet
*.sas7bdat

# ===============================
# ASReml raw run outputs (analysis/revision/asreml_pipeline/)
# .as/.pin job specs and parsed results/ summary tables ARE tracked --
# only the large/regenerable per-run artifacts are excluded here.
# ===============================
*.asr
*.rsv
*.msv
*.tsv
*.pvc
*.veo
*.yht
*.vvp
*.ask
*.asl
*.SRT
ainverse.bin
# The whole execution/staging directory (copies of models/*.as plus real
# phenotype/pedigree data and every raw per-run output) -- models/ and
# results/ are the git-tracked source of truth, run/ is regenerable from
# them via scripts/02_stage_run_dir.R.
analysis/revision/asreml_pipeline/run/

# ===============================
# Logs / caches
# ===============================
*.log
logs/
.cache/
Rplots.pdf
